// ===========================================================================
// MikuDanceStudio resources - thin index
// ===========================================================================
// All original resources are re-embedded byte-exact from the original
// MikuMikuDance.exe .rsrc tree by res/gen_resources.res /
// res/gen_resources_x64.res (regenerable via scripts/gen_resources.py):
//   SAMPLE02 / SAMPLE02E menus (8 popups, 103 commands each)
//   48 RT_DIALOG templates (600..817)
//   bitmaps 101/119, PNG 102..114, XFILE 115, RCDATA 117/118
//   icon group 100 (+ RT_ICON 1..6)
//   Common-Controls v6 manifest
//
// Editable sources live in res/assets/ (native formats: png/bmp/ico/fx/x)
// and res/templates/ (dialogs.rc / menus.rc - decoded source-text forms of
// the binary DIALOG/MENU templates; scripts/dialog_rc.py verify proves
// rc.exe re-emits the original bytes).  See res/README.md.
// =========================================================================//
